    "1",
    "4"
   ],
   "a": 3,
   "e": "Rationalising, 1/(√5 − 2) = √5 + 2 and 1/(√5 + 2) = √5 − 2, because (√5)² − 2² = 1. Their difference is (√5 + 2) − (√5 − 2) = 4."
